<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     LEGEND    x=40..300
     AMBIENT   x=40..300 (below legend; clears skip bus)
     LEFT      x=400..720 — skip / planner / END skip
     SPINE     x=780..1160 — gate → BA → handoff
     RIGHT     x=1260..1640 — optional researcher region

     BUSES (exclusive; miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=350   skip → END drain (west gutter)
       x=1230  route → researcher (spine|region gutter)
       x=1700  researcher → tech-lead rejoin (east)

     Chips sit OFF spine centerline.
     Researcher inset ≥40px inside dashed frame.
     No mid-stroke edge labels — chips only.
-->
